Z||000018||MinnGreenGT||11-30-2001||03:14 PM||||If you do a "save targe/link..." it should ask you where you want to save it to... it's an MPEG video, so the connection is not needed if you've saved it to your computer (I often have it download to the desktop...easiest place to find stuff).  Once you've downloaded it, locate it on your computer (find the icon) and check it's file size... should be about 41.?MB  The next time you want to watch it, you should be able to double click it and it should open using Windows media player (or some similiar video player) -no connection required.||||reg||1
